 "comment": [
  "The structure of a net across the hierarchy (\"graph\" on an equipotential",
  "body, from naja's equipotential graph), the same from both backends: run",
  "by python/tests/test_net_graph.py against protocol.py and by",
  "tests/provider/LocalSNLProviderProtocolTest.cpp against LocalSNLProvider.",
  "Same format as anonymous_protocol_cases.json; a net's \"term\" may list",
  "several terms (a feed-through). Net n at the top goes from drv.Y into",
  "u_mid (pin i) and on into u_mid/u_in (pin i) to the leaf g; into u_thru,",
  "whose ports i and o share one net w, and out again as net t to sink2; and",
  "into u_empty, where it reaches no pin: that branch is pruned. Net m comes",
  "out of u_mid/u_in and u_mid (pins o) to sink. Node and edge order is",
  "naja's discovery order, the same for both backends.",
  "crossing_assign_protocol_cases.json has the assign and bus cases."
 ],
